_REASON":"2025年年报显示，公司已实现在氢能产业链上制氢、膜电极、燃料电池电堆及系统、整车运营等关键环节的卡位布局。公司生产的燃料电池相关零部件主要包含：燃料电池系统、燃料电池电堆及膜电极，其中公司燃料电池电堆搭配雄韬氢雄等国内相关燃料电池系统企业，同时与国内知名乘用车车企联合开发合作。","IS_PRECISE":"1","BOARD_RANK":26,"BOARD_YIELD":null,"NEW_BOARD_CODE":"BK0900","DERIVE_BOARD_CODE":"BI0900","BOARD_TYPE":null,"BOARD_LEVEL":null},{"SECUCODE":"002733.SZ","SECURITY_CODE":"002733","SECURITY_NAME_ABBR":"雄韬股份","BOARD_CODE":"867","BOARD_NAME":"富时罗素","SELECTED_BOARD_REASON":null,"IS_PRECISE":"0","BOARD_RANK":10,"BOARD_YIELD":null,"NEW_BOARD_CODE":"BK0867","DERIVE_BOARD_CODE":"BI0867","BOARD_TYPE":null,"BOARD_LEVEL":null},{"SECUCODE":"002733.SZ","SECURITY_CODE":"002733","SECURITY_NAME_ABBR":"雄韬股份","BOARD_CODE":"864","BOARD_NAME":"氢能源","SELECTED_BOARD_REASON":"2025年半年报显示，作为国内氢能产业链的领先企业，雄韬集团依托自主研发的氢储能发电系统，为算力中心提供了全新的能源保障路径。系统采用定制开发的长寿命质子交换膜燃料电池电堆，并融合全球首创的碳纤维一体成型纸电堆技术，兼具石墨堆的超长寿命与金属堆的高功率密度，实现可靠性与性能的最佳平衡。","IS_PRECISE":"1","BOARD_RANK":24,"BOARD_YIELD":null,"NEW_BOARD_CODE":"BK0864","DERIVE_BOARD_CODE":"BI0864","BOARD_TYPE":null,"BOARD_LEVEL":null},{"SECUCODE":"002733.SZ","SECURITY_CODE":"002733","SECURITY_NAME_ABBR":"雄韬股份","BOARD_CODE":"816","BOARD_NAME":"昨日连板","SELECTED_BOARD_REASON":null,"IS_PRECISE":"0","BOARD_RANK":11,"BOARD_YIELD":null,"NEW_BOARD_CODE":"BK0816","DERIVE_BOARD_CODE":"BI0816","BOARD_TYPE":null,"BOARD_LEVEL":null},{"SECUCODE":"002733.SZ","SECURITY_CODE":"002733","SECURITY_NAME_ABBR":"雄韬股份","BOARD_CODE":"815","BOARD_NAME":"昨日涨停","SELECTED_BOARD_REASON":null,"IS_PRECISE":"0","BOARD_RANK":12,"BOARD_YIELD":null,"NEW_BOARD_CODE":"BK0815","DERIVE_BOARD_CODE":"BI0815","BOARD_TYPE":null,"BOARD_LEVEL":null},{"SECUCODE":"002733.SZ","SECURITY_CODE":"002733","SECURITY_NAME_ABBR":"雄韬股份","BOARD_CODE":"812","BOARD_NAME":"贬值受益","SELECTED_BOARD_REASON":"公司境外收入占比大于50%。","IS_PRECISE":"1","BOARD_RANK":25,"BOARD_YIELD":null,"NEW_BOARD_CODE":"BK0812","DERIVE_BOARD_CODE":"BI0812","BOARD_TYPE":null,"BOARD_LEVEL":null},{"SECUCODE":"002733.SZ","SECURITY_CODE":"002733","SECURITY_NAME_ABBR":"雄韬股份","BOARD_CODE":"804","BOAR